add("sleeptrain-1x89e9i", None, "new_mother", "toddler_12_24_months", "question", ["sleep_consultant", "price_value", "conflicting_advice"], "If you used a sleep consultant, did you find it worthwhile? I’m in the UK and would really appreciate recommendations, along with an idea of their approach and cost.", "15-month-old waking every 1-2 hours; mother breastfed to a year and does almost every bedtime.")
add("sleeptrain-1x89e9i", None, "new_mother", "toddler_12_24_months", "pain", ["cosleeping", "partner_split_nights", "maternal_exhaustion"], "At the moment, I end up bringing her into bed with me because I’m so exhausted and it’s the only way I’m getting any sleep. But the current arrangement isn’t working for me or my relationship", "Toddler only wants her overnight.")
add("sleeptrain-1x89e9i", None, "new_mother", "toddler_12_24_months", "desire", ["conflicting_advice", "information_overload"], "I’m feeling very overwhelmed by all the conflicting advice and would love a realistic way forward.", "Closing line before choosing whether to pay a consultant.")
add("NewParents-1x8h5ui", None, "parent_unspecified", "unknown", "price_signal", ["sleepwear", "price_value"], "PSA for parents considering a Woolino: you might be able to get one for around $57!", "Post title; parent stacks card offers and registry discounts worth $56.10 off a premium sleep sack.")
add("sleeptrain-1x8nyvq", None, "parent_unspecified", "unknown", "question", ["app_tracking", "price_value", "information_overload"], "i'm trying to decide whether those extras are worth paying for or if a reliable video feed and sound alerts are enough for day-to-day use.", "Shopping for a monitor with sleep-data insights.")
add("sleeptrain-1x8nyvq", None, "parent_unspecified", "unknown", "fear", ["app_tracking", "information_overload"], "i'm curious how these compare in actual use, especially when it comes to understanding sleep patterns without getting overwhelmed by too much data.", "Comparing three smart monitors.")
add("sleeptrain-1x8w8so", None, "parent_unspecified", "toddler_12_24_months", "trigger_moment", ["ads_seen", "course_purchase", "sleep_consultant"], "Of course because I text and post about lack of sleep, all I see is ads for sleep programs, sleep training professional help, yadda yadda.", "Post title: Paying for sleep training help. 16-month-old waking screaming for six weeks; only nursing settles her.")
add("sleeptrain-1x8w8so", None, "parent_unspecified", "toddler_12_24_months", "question", ["course_purchase", "price_value", "money_back"], "So I’m curious - is there any paid sleep programs that anyone here has paid for that they would say were absolutely worth the money and they truly worked???", "Never considered sleep training before the 15-month change.")
add("sleeptrain-1x8w8so", None, "parent_unspecified", "toddler_12_24_months", "price_signal", ["sleep_consultant", "price_value"], "One program I saw charges $1,000 for 2 weeks of hardcore sleep help, like they come to your house and help if needed. Are all these paid programs a scam? Is there any that actually work?", "Weighing an in-home sleep program.")
add("sleeptrain-1x8w8so", None, "parent_unspecified", "toddler_12_24_months", "fear", ["sleep_training_values", "transition_to_cot"], "My worry about sleep training is that it will result in her only being able to sleep in her room, in her crib. We travel a lot. She stays with friends and relatives a lot. We camp a lot.", "Objection to sleep training from a family that travels.")
add("sleeptrain-1x8w8so", "phi4tye", "parent_unspecified", "toddler_12_24_months", "desire", ["personalization", "feeding_to_sleep"], "I guess that’s my biggest step I’m overwhelmed to take is finding an age appropriate sleep training method that will not only sleep train but also help eliminate the feed to sleep association", "Reply to commenters.")
add("sleeptrain-1x92yfi", None, "new_mother", "baby_5_8_months", "tried_failed", ["app_tracking", "night_wakings"], "I recently started using napper app (4 weeks ago) to get my son into a better routine.", "First-time mum of a 6.5-month-old; nights worsening again.")
add("sleeptrain-1x92yfi", None, "new_mother", "baby_5_8_months", "belief", ["app_tracking", "personalization"], "I don’t know what I’m doing wrong? Or perhaps the napper app is a bit off.", "App suggests four naps a day; wakes at 11, 12, 1 and 2.")
add("sleeptrain-1x92yfi", None, "new_mother", "baby_5_8_months", "question", ["night_wakings"], "At which point, I’m exhausted. Is he not tired enough? Cold? Hungry? Missing me? I have no idea", "Listing possible causes of night wakings.")
add("sleeptrain-1x952j9", None, "new_mother", "baby_2_4_months", "purchase", ["sleep_consultant", "pick_up_put_down", "contact_naps"], "We have hired a sleep coach to help us for sleep training once he’s developmentally ready at 4 months. In the meantime she has suggested that we use the PUPD method to help.", "First-time mum of a 10-week-old; parents take shifts holding him asleep.")
add("sleeptrain-1x952j9", None, "new_mother", "baby_2_4_months", "fear", ["contact_naps", "partner_split_nights"], "But when I’m sitting in a dark room holding him as he sleeps and my mind starts to wander I get pretty scared that this won’t be “fixable”.", "Pick-up-put-down still only gives 20-minute stretches.")
add("sleeptrain-1x99yep", None, "parent_unspecified", "regression_4_months", "tried_failed", ["sleep_consultant", "bedtime_battle"], "We hired a consultants and we came up with a schedule that helped a little but we are still facing some issues.", "5-month-old wakes 45-60 minutes after bedtime and screams for 1-2 hours.")
add("sleeptrain-1x99yep", "phju97g", "parent_unspecified", "regression_4_months", "objection", ["sleep_consultant", "cry_it_out", "gentle_method"], "We are not really open to the cry it out methods. The biggest challange is the our little one is very dramatic.", "Working with a consultant for a couple of weeks.")
add("sleeptrain-1x9b8en", None, "parent_unspecified", "toddler_12_24_months", "others_said", ["cry_it_out", "conflicting_advice"], "Basically, the doctor told me I was coddling him by going in to comfort him after 15 minutes of crying, and I needed to let him cry “all night, if necessary” without going in the room in order for him to get the picture.", "Visited a sleep medicine clinic at 10 months when the adults averaged 2.5 hours of sleep.")
add("sleeptrain-1x9b8en", None, "parent_unspecified", "toddler_12_24_months", "others_said", ["guilt"], "Said I was keeping him awake for my own selfish purposes. Wouldn’t schedule a sleep study.", "Same clinic visit.")
add("sleeptrain-1x9b8en", None, "parent_unspecified", "toddler_12_24_months", "regret", ["cry_it_out", "sleep_training_values"], "We resorted to crying in the pack n play next to me after about 10 months old, many times, and it fucking sucked to be blunt. I hated it, but we had quite literally no other choice.", "After months of midnight-4am wakes since the 4-month change.")
add("sleeptrain-1x9b8en", None, "parent_unspecified", "toddler_12_24_months", "fear", ["sleep_training_values"], "I’m just concerned about our bond/attachment. I thought it was solved, but we’re teetering back to old behaviors", "18-month-old anxious at sleep again.")
add("sleeptrain-1x9c6j8", None, "new_mother", "regression_4_months", "purchase", ["night_nanny", "twins", "sleep_training_values"], "when they were about 2m old we hired a night nanny when my husband had to go back to work. She came highly recommended by my OB who used her for her twins.", "First-time mother of twins; the nanny was to sleep train them at 4 months.")
add("sleeptrain-1x9c6j8", "phkqaym", "new_mother", "regression_4_months", "belief", ["night_nanny", "swaddle_transition"], "might as well rip off the bandaid while I still have the help.", "Last few weeks with the paid night help.")
add("beyondthebump-1x9ngjg", None, "parent_unspecified", "baby_9_12_months", "tried_failed", ["app_tracking", "nap_transition"], "I got the huckleberry app and got him a decent routine. He’s transitioning from 2 naps to 1 because I cannot for the life of me get him down for a second nap.", "12-month-old who has struggled to sleep since birth.")
add("beyondthebump-1x9ngjg", None, "parent_unspecified", "baby_9_12_months", "pain", ["bedtime_battle", "schedule_rigidity"], "I spend at least 2 hours of my day, today is 3 hours, trying to get my baby to sleep and I am done. I feel like so much of my time is just down the drain.", "Weekly family visit wrecks bedtime.")
add("beyondthebump-1x9ngjg", None, "parent_unspecified", "baby_9_12_months", "pain", ["schedule_rigidity"], "I honestly never want to leave the house because any deviation from the normal being at home the second half of the day, destroys his sleep.", "About Sunday visits to the in-laws.")
add("beyondthebump-1x9ngjg", "phmyqz4", "parent_unspecified", "baby_9_12_months", "fear", ["schedule_rigidity"], "We didn’t have a good schedule until 7 month old and I’m so scared of messing it up haha", "Asking how others handle late nights.")
add("sleeptrain-1x9vaem", None, "parent_unspecified", "baby_5_8_months", "purchase", ["sleep_consultant", "wake_windows", "personalization"], "Eventually got the help of a sleep coach who said his sleep budget is around 12.75-13 hrs. Based on this she suggested a routine of 3.25/3.5/4.5, with naps capped at 2 hrs a day and bedtime at 8 PM.", "8.5-month-old after the 3-to-2 nap transition.")
add("sleeptrain-1x9vaem", None, "parent_unspecified", "baby_5_8_months", "objection", ["sleep_consultant", "guilt"], "I feel awful capping his naps and I'm not sure if it's doing much to increase his night sleep.", "Baby 'shattered' by end of day on the coach's schedule.")
add("sleeptrain-1x9vaem", "phoobdr", "parent_unspecified", "baby_5_8_months", "purchase", ["sleep_consultant", "personalization", "app_tracking"], "We tracked his sleep for a week and she calculated it based on that. I picked her cause she's very much driven by neuroscience and not of the 'sleep begets sleep' camp.", "Why they chose this coach: a plan calculated from their own logs.")
add("sleeptrain-1x9vaem", "pi0evbp", "parent_unspecified", "baby_5_8_months", "success_story", ["free_advice", "wake_windows", "personalization"], "he sleeps a solid 10.5 hours now from 8:30 PM till 7 AM!", "Two days later, after commenters suggested more daytime sleep than the coach's plan allowed.")
add("sleeptrain-1xa220s", None, "parent_unspecified", "regression_4_months", "success_story", ["book_purchase", "course_purchase", "gentle_method"], "Third night she only cried 6 min and fell asleep! A few nights later, no crying and feel asleep! Amazing!", "Gradual training at 4 months from a book and a course; new rolling later disrupted it.")
add("sleeptrain-1xaixrr", None, "partner", "baby_5_8_months", "pain", ["ferber", "maternal_exhaustion", "feeding_to_sleep"], "The alternative is waking up every 45-1 hour and nursing back to sleep, he will not go back to sleep by himself and that is killing my wife waking up 6-8 time a night sometimes more.", "Father writing on night 7 of a second Ferber attempt with a 5.5-month-old.")
add("sleeptrain-1xaixrr", None, "partner", "baby_5_8_months", "others_said", ["sleep_consultant", "ferber", "guilt"], "We have a sleep coach currently, she said she’s never seen a baby cry this long after 7 days so you can imagine how that makes us feel as parents.", "Crying at least 90 minutes every night.")
add("sleeptrain-1xaixrr", None, "partner", "baby_5_8_months", "fear", ["ferber", "guilt", "sleep_training_values"], "we don’t want to go another week just to see no improvements and end up quitting and have made him cry for nothing anyways.", "Deciding whether to continue.")
add("sleeptrain-1xaixrr", "19rhmai6sk6ys", "partner", "baby_5_8_months", "success_story", ["ferber", "consistency_failure"], "he only cried for 25 minutes at bedtime and another 20 minutes around 2:30am, but he slept for 10.5 hours last night—which is unheard of for him. So, something is working.", "Night nine of the second Ferber attempt.")
add("sleeptrain-1xatmjl", None, "experienced_mother", "baby_5_8_months", "pain", ["short_naps", "comparison_other_babies", "guilt"], "People ask what’s his napping schedule, and I’m like uhh there’s not and I’m starting to feel like a failure.", "7-month-old breastfed fourth-or-later child naps only minutes a day; never had this with her other kids.")
add("sleeptrain-1xatmjl", None, "experienced_mother", "baby_5_8_months", "objection", ["sleep_consultant", "price_value"], "I am even considering hiring a sleep coach which in the past I have rolled my eyes at. But here we are….", "After trying every wake window.")
add("sleeptrain-1xatmjl", None, "experienced_mother", "baby_5_8_months", "tried_failed", ["wake_windows", "short_naps"], "I have tried every wake window. Waiting two hours so he’s not over tired, waiting 3-3.5 because maybe he’s not tired enough?", "Nap struggle with a Ferber-trained baby.")
add("NewParents-1xbm9i1", None, "parent_unspecified", "baby_5_8_months", "objection", ["sleep_consultant", "price_value", "money_back"], "We are desperate and are thinking about paying for a sleep consultant but they’re expensive and no guarantee it will work.", "20-week-old, previously sleeping 12 hours, now awake 3 hours at 2-3am.")
add("NewParents-1xbm9i1", None, "parent_unspecified", "baby_5_8_months", "tried_failed", ["cry_it_out"], "We’ve tried sleep training but the crying gets to us after an hour.", "Split nights.")
add("sleeptrain-1xbnld4", None, "parent_unspecified", "toddler_24_36_months", "failure_story", ["sleep_consultant", "transition_to_cot"], "Our daughter is 3 and we had her sleep trained with a sleep coach. In her crib sleep was super easy, but things have changed now that she’s 3, fully potty trained (including nights), and in her big girl bed.", "Coach-trained baby; the plan did not cover the toddler bed years later.")
add("sleeptrain-1xbnld4", None, "parent_unspecified", "toddler_24_36_months", "pain", ["night_wakings", "bedtime_battle"], "Between 1AM and 7:15AM she wakes 2-6 times and comes to our room saying she needs to pee or had a bad dream and wants us to tuck her in.", "Three-year-old in a big bed with a hallway gate.")
add("NewParents-1xbwaxs", None, "parent_unspecified", "regression_4_months", "tried_failed", ["sleep_consultant", "contact_naps", "transition_to_cot"], "a sleep coach encouraged us to begin transferring to the crib for the first nap of the day. So far we aren’t having much success and it ruins the nap.", "16-week-old napping in the carrier.")
add("sleeptrain-1xby01p", None, "partner", "baby_5_8_months", "success_story", ["app_tracking", "book_purchase", "short_naps"], "We had a lot of success with this and we absolutely nailed daytime naps. It was game changing and we use huckleberry for sweet spots, also read precious little sleep which had some good info.", "Father describing independent sleep from 4 months after months of rocking and yoga ball.")
add("sleeptrain-1xby01p", None, "partner", "baby_5_8_months", "belief", ["night_wakings", "feeding_to_sleep", "cosleeping"], "This has maybe backfired as he probably thinks if he cries every two hours he will get fed. My wife breastfeeds at night and will often bring him into our bed", "6.5-month-old still waking every 2.5-3 hours.")
